# hair/adult/highponytail_hang: the High ponytail's tail: it arcs back from the crown ribbon and falls behind the head to the
# shoulders; it lags the step (hair keys) and lies flat under a lying head (lie: none)
# P2b wave 2, HAIR. On the adult head box (STYLE_P2 21). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role hair highponytail
layer hairBack
anchor head
keys hair
z 1

